["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どうして</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">怎样；用什么方法；以什么方式；为什么；为了什么目的；何必；不可能；怎么可能；不行；绝对不行</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201572\">どうしてあなたは<ruby>一人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になったの？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">为什么你独自一人?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どうしても</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">无论如何；一定要；必须；势必；无论愿不愿意；不得不；被迫；决不；绝对不；无论如何不；终究；到底；最后；毕竟</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"149573\"><ruby>残念<rp>(</rp><rt>ざんねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですが、あなたの<ruby>名前<rp>(</rp><rt>なまえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をどうしても<ruby>覚<rp>(</rp><rt>おぼ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えられない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不幸的是,我还不记得你的名字。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同時</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">同时；同一时间；同时的；同步的；并行的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227381\">お<ruby>菓子<rp>(</rp><rt>かし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていたり<ruby>同時<rp>(</rp><rt>どうじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べたりはできない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你不能同时吃糖果,也不能同时吃。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同情</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同情；怜悯</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"118332\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のことを<ruby>同情<rp>(</rp><rt>どうじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せずにはいられない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不能不同情他。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">道場</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">道场；武术训练厅；修行道场</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どうせ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">无论如何；不管怎样；反正；终究；反正结果都一样（不妨…）；既然如此；横竖都一样</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201391\">どうせお<ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>まえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不管是你。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どうぞ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">请；敬请；恳请；尽管；当然；请随意；欢迎；请自便；给你；拿着；给予</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"149251\"><ruby>写真<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をどうぞ<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せて<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请让我看下照片吧。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2393872\" title=\"Tatoeba · fenfang557\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fenfang557\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どうぞよろしく</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">久仰；幸会；初次见面，请多关照；请代为问好；致意；祝好</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201303\">どうぞよろしく。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请你好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同調</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうちょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同调；一致；协调；共鸣；随声附和；（电学）调谐；同音；同音高</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211291\">その<ruby>計画<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>同調<rp>(</rp><rt>どうちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在这个计划中,我同意了他。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">動的</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうてき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">动态的；动的；运动的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同等</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうとう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">平等；同等；同权；等同</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"127269\"><ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>女<rp>(</rp><rt>おんな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>同等<rp>(</rp><rt>どうとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だと<ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>せつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>感<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">男人和女人都觉得平等。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">道徳</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうとく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">道德；道德观念</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101627\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>道徳<rp>(</rp><rt>どうとく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>力<rp>(</rp><rt>りょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>欠<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他缺乏道德能力。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">堂々</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうどう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">堂皇；宏大；气派；庄严；雄伟；威严；肃穆；光明正大；坦荡；公开；理直气壮；厚颜无耻；堂堂正正地；大胆地；自信地；光明正大地；坦率地；毫无保留地；厚颜无耻地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どうにか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">总算；好歹；勉强；设法</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"159340\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどうにか<ruby>家族<rp>(</rp><rt>かぞく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>養<rp>(</rp><rt>やしな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我以某种方式养育我的家人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">導入</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうにゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">导入；引进；安装；设置；进口；导言；引言；开场白</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228544\">いまだにインターネットの<ruby>導入<rp>(</rp><rt>どうにゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>検討<rp>(</rp><rt>けんとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している<ruby>会社<rp>(</rp><rt>かいしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">目前还有一些公司正在考虑引入互联网。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同封</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうふう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同封；附寄</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"88696\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>小切手<rp>(</rp><rt>こぎって</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>同封<rp>(</rp><rt>どうふう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>送<rp>(</rp><rt>おく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってくれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她拿起一支支票,把它送给我。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">動物</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうぶつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">动物</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"159921\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>動物<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>名前<rp>(</rp><rt>なまえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我知道那只动物的名字。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">動物園</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうぶつえん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">动物园；动物园林</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217495\">コンドルは<ruby>動物園<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぶつえん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>けっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>育<rp>(</rp><rt>そだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">昆多尔从来没有在动物园里生长过。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同盟</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうめい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同盟；联盟；联合</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201754\">ドイツはイタリアと<ruby>同盟<rp>(</rp><rt>どうめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>結<rp>(</rp><rt>むす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">德国与意大利联盟。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どうも</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">谢谢；感谢；非常（感谢）；很（抱歉）；颇（遗憾）；相当；实在；大体上；不知为何；莫名其妙地；不由自主地；无论怎么努力；无论如何也（做不到）；你好；再见</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230516\">あの<ruby>二人<rp>(</rp><rt>ふたり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどうもできているらしい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这两个人似乎都很感激。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どうやら</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">似乎；好像；看起来；可能；勉强；费力地；好不容易；勉勉强强</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201130\">どうやら<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べ<ruby>過<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎたみたいだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">似乎吃过太多。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">動揺</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">摇晃；颤动；摇摆；振荡；骚动；不安；激动；混乱；心神不宁</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223410\">このニュースを<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて<ruby>非常<rp>(</rp><rt>ひじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>動揺<rp>(</rp><rt>どうよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">听到这个消息,我很生气。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同様</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同样；相似；一样；相同</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221386\">この<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>新車<rp>(</rp><rt>しんしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>同様<rp>(</rp><rt>どうよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这辆车像新的。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/379145\" title=\"Tatoeba · kellenparker\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · kellenparker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同僚</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうりょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同事；同僚；合作者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101641\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>同僚<rp>(</rp><rt>どうりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>となかなか<ruby>打<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ち<ruby>解<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他不能和同事做得太好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">動力</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうりょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">动力；驱动力；三相电</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212638\">そのボートは<ruby>動力<rp>(</rp><rt>どうりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にモーターを<ruby>使用<rp>(</rp><rt>しよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">船只使用动力发动机。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">道路</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</spa